      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I recently had an issue like that. There was no Unity Crash image or anything in the logs hinting at what could've possibly caused the crash. I did find that Unity itself created a crash log but it doesn't say anything more then that the main Unity thread is what crashed.\n\nI did however have a way to reproduce the issue. Whenever VRChat tries to load this avatar in the Open Beta, it immediatly crashes to desktop, even the preview in the menu will crash the game. Name of the avi is \"Krantu V2\" and it's ID is avtr_51e84783-9d3f-4830-a449-b2451b96ed6e.\n\nNo idea what's wrong with it as it isn't my avatar. All I know is that it works just fine with no logged errors in Unity 2019...\n\nTho I should mention this happened in Build 1342. So probably unrelated...",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
