      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think this is still happening as of 1344. I guess these could still be just avatar crashers but other people in the instance seem to be fine.\n\nTail end of logs and videos of two crashes. \n\nhttps://pastebin.com/qapVn9br \n\nRecording: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k1Xu1frZFWc\n\nhttps://pastebin.com/CFganML1 \n\nRecording: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NKBbkV0x_xc\n\nI have not played on live version for quite a while since IK and open betas have been active since early August. The only time I have experienced these types of instant crashes were with corrupted asset bundle crasher avatars but that was a long time ago now.",
